      "id": "claim_b7a980c9d6814d4288ca1b53c63e18d4",
      "statement": "app.py uses all three LangSmith tracing mechanisms together: @traceable on the pipeline stages and both root entrypoints with chain/retriever run types, wrap_openai on the module-level OpenAI client, and an explicit trace() context inside generate_response that records formatted_docs as input and the answer as output. _run_pipeline shares orchestration between arxiv_copilot and arxiv_copilot_with_sources, which traces under the same arxiv_copilot name with process_outputs reducing the tuple to the answer.",
